  "content": "<h1>使物品可堆疊至64個</h1><p><strong>此模組讓一些原本無法堆疊的物品變得可堆疊，並讓一些只能堆疊至16個的物品可堆疊至64個。</strong></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c60e34de98727d1808c395cb120db79ea9c2aabd.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/22bc3b74a095f1860e0c826130a5b775016e49b3.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><h3>藥水</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cc0e615d6a78b7ad38a721ac913e536fbc5f7fe0.gif\" alt=\"藥水\"></p><h3>不死圖騰</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0224ab0656199be857586cb3c6595512a078dbbc.gif\" alt=\"圖騰\"></p><h3>粉雪</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d78504110aea359f9730b19160c678ed2ea335b0.gif\" alt=\"粉雪\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/22bc3b74a095f1860e0c826130a5b775016e49b3.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><h2>物品</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2a06cad9ca317672139d9e3d1ce431fde608095b.png\" alt=\"物品\"></p><h2>馬鎧</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a87ca5cfa5f70e31e18c2c5ec3bab34bf973e631.png\" alt=\"馬\"></p><h2>礦車</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/10f410bd6d92aafcea3fbafd3b880b9b1b1ccc1e.png\" alt=\"礦車\"></p><h2>桶子</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/478842c9c46c3bbc95aa9c6cc22625e4c34ffc03.png\" alt=\"桶子\"></p><h2>床</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/12960476335205502281230ad8883de8bd1b108b.png\" alt=\"床\"></p><h2>藥水</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/33ccc8cb855c87fbd70e899f36e57676c8f4c14b.png\" alt=\"藥水\"></p><h2>旗幟</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a0ad6c815a598cd54511219449f6ab194502030a.png\" alt=\"旗幟\"></p><h2>船</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/960b0757e43eae00a9609d6bb262ca4d4f4e5249.png\" alt=\"船\"></p><hr><h1>更新內容</h1><h2>棕色蛋與藍色蛋</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aee1e3b67d0dd999e761e28b827d02f72e55094e.png\" alt=\"蛋\"></p><h2>鸚鵡螺殼盔甲</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/878cc1d73b6d2fa45e7f94fbc005e09985206a35.png\" alt=\"鸚鵡螺殼\"></p>",
